<title>UK: Eurotunnel H1 loss narrows to 372 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel H1 loss narrows to 372 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Share (loss, pence)    40.4		   vs 52.3 loss</p>
<p> Net loss		   371.72		 vs 464.51 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   223.68		 vs 104.54</p>
<p> Net interest payable   332.45		 vs 364.58</p>
<p> Accrued interest	 610		    vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - The accounts reflect the ongoing standstill on Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc's junior debt. Negotiations with banks to reschedule or reconstruct its debt continue.  </p>
<p> Operating costs	  180.3		  vs 159.39</p>
<p> Depreciation	     71.13		  vs 67.87</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
